{"id":"b963bc19cca0cdb2","group":"93","path":"93/93-ex-lattice-distributive.md","title":"Distributive Lattice","display":"Distributive Lattice","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ex-lattice-distributive","aliases":["93-ex-lattice-distributive"],"display":"Distributive Lattice","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-distributive-lattice]]","[[93-lem-distributive-identity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ex-lattice-distributive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ex-lattice-distributive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Distributive Lattice"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc98242032b14823\" href=\"?note=fc98242032b14823\" title=\"93-df-distributive-lattice\">93-df-distributive-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f983e6b98c86a8fa\" href=\"?note=f983e6b98c86a8fa\" title=\"93-lem-distributive-identity\">93-lem-distributive-identity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"ex-lattice-distributive---Distributive-Lattice\">ex-lattice-distributive - Distributive Lattice</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_3\">\\(a_3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_3\">\\(C_3\\)</span>, the two operation graphs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_3,j_3\">\\(m_3,j_3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C_3\">\\(\\mathbf C_3\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc98242032b14823\" href=\"?note=fc98242032b14823\" title=\"93-df-distributive-lattice\">93-df-distributive-lattice</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\na_3\\coloneqq\\langle5,0\\rangle,\n\\qquad C_3\\coloneqq\\{0,a_3,1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\na_3\\coloneqq\\langle5,0\\rangle,\n\\qquad C_3\\coloneqq\\{0,a_3,1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\nm_3\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\langle\\langle0,0\\rangle,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle0,a_3\\rangle,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle0,1\\rangle,0\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\langle a_3,0\\rangle,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle a_3,a_3\\rangle,a_3\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle a_3,1\\rangle,a_3\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\langle1,0\\rangle,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle1,a_3\\rangle,a_3\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle1,1\\rangle,1\\rangle\\},\\\\\nj_3\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\langle\\langle0,0\\rangle,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle0,a_3\\rangle,a_3\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle0,1\\rangle,1\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\langle a_3,0\\rangle,a_3\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle a_3,a_3\\rangle,a_3\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle a_3,1\\rangle,1\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\langle1,0\\rangle,1\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle1,a_3\\rangle,1\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle1,1\\rangle,1\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf C_3\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\langle C_3,m_3,j_3\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" ta