inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M_3\">\\(\\mathbf M_3\\)</span> and pentagon <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf N_5\">\\(\\mathbf N_5\\)</span> are instead the two\nstandard five-element obstructions to distributivity.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-lattice-distributive---Distributive-Lattice","text":"ex-lattice-distributive - Distributive Lattice","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"fc98242032b14823","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-lem-distributive-identity","status":"resolved","id":"f983e6b98c86a8fa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-lem-distributive-identity]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"fc98242032b14823","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-distributive-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a_3","display":false},{"tex":"C_3","display":false},{"tex":"m_3,j_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\na_3\\coloneqq\\langle5,0\\rangle,\n\\qquad C_3\\coloneqq\\{0,a_3,1\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}distributive}\\vdash\nm_3\\coloneqq\\{&\\langle\\langle0,0\\rangle,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle0,a_3\\rangle,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\langle0,1\\rangle,0\\ra